# Keep host build artifacts out of the Docker build context. Every app image
# installs its own dependencies (npm ci / pip install) and builds from source
# inside the container, so host node_modules/dist/venv must never be copied in —
# doing so clobbers the clean in-container install (e.g. non-executable .bin/tsc
# from a host install → "tsc: Permission denied").
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.output
**/venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.git
**/.vite
**/.DS_Store
